| Prescan | Gemini 2.5 Flash | Google | Pre-analysis quick checks |

**Design note:** OpenAI currently handles 4 of 7 roles (Evaluator B, Challenger, Cascade, Severity). This concentration is a known consideration. Each role uses different constrained prompts, maintaining functional independence per Patent Claim 2. A future iteration may redistribute the challenger role to Anthropic for stronger cross-provider independence.

**Why these specific models:**
- Gemini 3.1 Pro: Best long-context performance for extraction (processes two 30+ page documents in one call)
- Claude Sonnet 4: Strong analytical reasoning at reasonable cost
- GPT-5.2: Good at structured JSON output, reliable for adversarial probing
- Grok 3: Different training data/perspective, adds genuine diversity to evaluation

